# Breakout's sprites in sheet.qoi. The bevels are gray so the game tints them; the panel is
# solid white. `cargo test -p titan --test breakout_replay` checks sheet.qoi against the
# generator in tests/breakout_replay.rs, and rewrites it with TITAN_BLESS=1.
atlas 48 22
brick 0 0 32 12
ball 34 0 12 12
paddle 0 14 32 8
panel 34 14 2 2
